{"id":8867095642311,"title":"Horse Patchwork Pattern Quilt, Animal Farmhouse Quilt Set Patchwork","handle":"horse-patchwork-pattern-quilt-animal-farmhouse-quilt-set-patchwork","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic elegance with our Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring countryside charm and warmth to your bedroom. This quilt set features classic patterns and soft fabrics, perfect for adding a touch of tradition and cozy comfort to your home, and makes a thoughtful personalized gift for loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Farmhouse Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features classic patterns and a charming patchwork style, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your name and select from various sizes, with the option to add more pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102''x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results, maintaining its fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003